    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Road Toads is a frantic local multiplayer party game for 2 to 8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Road Toads casts you and your friends as cute animals as you brave the dangers of the woodland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A twist on the classic Frogger, Road Toads pitches you against your friends as you barge into each other across roads, woods and rivers, darting between cars and each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive local multiplayer</strong> for 2 to 8 players on keyboard or with controllers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated levels</strong> to ensure every experience is unique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong>. The only controls are the four movement directions making the game incredibly easy to pick up. However under the surface there is a rich depth of gameplay as players learn to push and shove or dodge away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429480/extras/bbaa99fba1130e078aa69d10e8d77afe.poster.avif?t=1739743259\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429480/extras/bbaa99fba1130e078aa69d10e8d77afe.webm?t=1739743259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429480/extras/bbaa99fba1130e078aa69d10e8d77afe.mp4?t=1739743259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Road Toads is a frantic local multiplayer party game for 2 to 8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Road Toads casts you and your friends as cute animals as you brave the dangers of the woodland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A twist on the classic Frogger, Road Toads pitches you against your friends as you barge into each other across roads, woods and rivers, darting between cars and each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive local multiplayer</strong> for 2 to 8 players on keyboard or with controllers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated levels</strong> to ensure every experience is unique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong>. The only controls are the four movement directions making the game incredibly easy to pick up. However under the surface there is a rich depth of gameplay as players learn to push and shove or dodge away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429480/extras/bbaa99fba1130e078aa69d10e8d77afe.poster.avif?t=1739743259\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429480/extras/bbaa99fba1130e078aa69d10e8d77afe.webm?t=1739743259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429480/extras/bbaa99fba1130e078aa69d10e8d77afe.mp4?t=1739743259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
